{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23932","headline":"予与微之老而无子发於言叹着在诗篇今年冬各有一子戏作二什一以相贺一以自嘲 二 · 白居易","name":"予与微之老而无子发於言叹着在诗篇今年冬各有一子戏作二什一以相贺一以自嘲 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五十八翁方有後，静思堪喜亦堪嗟。\n一珠甚小还惭蚌，八子虽多不羡鸦。\n秋月晚生丹桂实，春风新长紫兰芽。\n持桮祝愿无他语，慎勿顽愚似汝爷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}